# Your Feb 2026 Flutter + FastAPI build. Kept on disk, out of this repo.
legacy

# Copied from node_modules by scripts/copy-sqlite.mjs
public/sqlite-wasm

# Raw USDA download - source data, not a build input worth versioning
FoodData_Central_*

# Your food data. Every one of these is a record of what the two of you
# actually eat, and this repo is public — the dish table itself, the weighing
# worksheets, the anchors derived from them. They live on disk and go into the
# app through the Library screen, never in here.
#
# A blanket rule on the root rather than a list, because the list kept growing
# and the failure mode is silent: `git add -A` sweeps up a new one and nobody
# notices until it is pushed. Anything that genuinely belongs in the repo can
# be un-ignored below, deliberately.
/*.csv

# Context handoff for whoever picks this up next. Notes on how we work, not
# code, and it names the two of us. Hand it over as a file.
HANDOFF.md

# Working notes for the next Claude session (where things stand, what is
# next, how we work) and the per-push development report. Local for the same
# reason as HANDOFF.md.
Claude_memory.md
Development_report.md

# wrangler dev --local keeps its miniflare state (the local D1) here
.wrangler
